      "ideaId": "IDEA_ID",
      "kind": "note",
      "body": "**Bambusicola**\n\nThe sister genus used as the outgroup for the competing living-Gallus roots. Calibrated analyses place the Gallus–Bambusicola split around 15–16 Ma, as a molecular-clock estimate. [Hosner et al. 2017](https://doi.org/10.1098/rspb.2017.0210); [Wang et al. 2017](https://doi.org/10.1111/jbi.12782)",
