      "ideaId": "IDEA_ID",
      "kind": "note",
      "body": "**Living Gallus · four-species inventory**\n\nRed G. gallus, green G. varius, grey G. sonneratii, and Sri Lankan G. lafayettii. The inventory is stable; the first living branch is not. Cross-species gene flow means a strictly bifurcating history is also an incomplete simplification.",
      "position": { "x": 9700, "y": 2460 }
    }
  },
  {
    "version": 1,
    "id": "v4-living-green-first",
