    "payload": {
      "ideaId": "IDEA_ID",
      "kind": "note",
      "body": "**Hypothesis G1 · green junglefowl first**\n\n(G. varius, (G. gallus, (G. sonneratii, G. lafayettii)))\n\nRecovered across multiple genomic partitions from about 32 million aligned bases and 3,406 gene trees. One captive individual represented each non-red species, and ancient gene flow was detected. [Tiley et al. 2020](https://doi.org/10.1186/s40657-020-00194-w)",
      "position": { "x": 10140, "y": 2200 }
    }
  },
  {
    "version": 1,
