    "name": "card.create",
    "payload": {
      "ideaId": "IDEA_ID",
      "kind": "note",
      "body": "**Hypothesis G2 · red junglefowl first**\n\n(G. gallus, (G. varius, (G. sonneratii, G. lafayettii)))\n\nFavored with 149 samples, more than 35 million SNPs, captive-hybrid screening, and two wild Indian grey junglefowl. Captive admixture and gene flow may distort an apparent root. [Mariadassou et al. 2021](https://doi.org/10.1016/j.ympev.2020.107044)",
      "position": { "x": 10140, "y": 2720 }
    }
  },
